          "title": "Project 89 prototype notice",
          "file": "NOTICE.md",
          "text": "# Project 89 prototype notice\n\nThis pack is an implementation prototype derived from public Project 89\nmaterials and the linked Project 89 portal. Its new prose, residents, faction\ndetails, mechanics, and topology are CosyWorld design proposals rather than\nclaims about approved Project 89 canon.\n\nDistribution, permanent voice, and production art require confirmation from\nthe relevant Project 89 rights holders. The pack does not grant rights in\nProject 89 names, lore, NFT media, or collection assets.\n\nThe Agent Memory Seed is deliberately not a seeded item. It must be created by\nthe future wallet-backed actor materialization capability and follow the\ncorresponding asset custody receipt."
        }
